<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>手账扫描页 - 藏的房子</title>
<script>
window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };
</script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js" async></script>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: #e8e8e8;
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .page {
    width: 540px;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* Top photo area: notebook cover with illustration */
  .cover-photo {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 380px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #cfe8f5 0%, #cfe8f5 30%, #f3ead2 30%, #f3ead2 60%, #dfe9c8 60%, #dfe9c8 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #333;
  }
  .cover-photo .placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #555;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-align: center;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0 40px, rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 40px 80px);
    border: none;
  }
  .cover-caption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 8px;
    left: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #444;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  /* Bottom lined-paper text area */
  .notebook {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 20px 22px 30px 26px;
    background-color: #fdfdfd;
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent 0px,
      transparent 27px,
      #cfe3ef 28px
    );
    line-height: 28px;
    font-family: "Kaiti SC", "STKaiti", "楷体", cursive, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    color: #234;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .notebook p {
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }

  .indent {
    text-indent: 2em;
  }

  .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 40%, #f7f27a 40%, #f7f27a 85%, transparent 85%);
  }

  .title-line {
    color: #1a3d7c;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .spacer {
    height: 14px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">

  <!-- Top image: notebook cover illustration -->
  <div class="cover-photo">
    <div class="placeholder">
      [Photo: notebook / journal cover — folded corner design, illustrated birds (orioles) along top edge, floral and cactus motifs on left panel, deer/fox and wildflowers on right panel, small ink drawing of a person sketching in center-left]
    </div>
    <div class="cover-caption">[Illustration: full-width, decorative journal cover]</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bottom: handwritten notebook text -->
  <div class="notebook">

    <p>藏的房子，让黑夜点亮同的灯，让水流灵通的渠，寻找梦想的路，寻找诗<br>
    一样醒的枕头，读懂生命的哭义。</p>

    <div class="spacer"></div>

    <p>刃不是循规蹈矩，那是遵守规矩，是尽然明目黑，喑，仍然为无明而<br>
    生的心。</p>

    <div class="spacer"></div>

    <p>我是未来的光，照耀未来之前的路。</p>

    <div class="spacer"></div>

    <p class="indent">情怀与理想并不相符，美好与向坦可以并存。</p>

    <div class="spacer"></div>

    <p class="indent">情怀依旧火热，灵魂依旧灼烧，理想依旧激突，向光的时候浅浅<br>
    旧止。</p>

    <div class="spacer"></div>

    <p>清晨的草原空气甘甜，吐鲁番早晨的甜瓜新鲜，拉萨的雪山一脉<br>
    理到尽头，秦岭学岩，兵马俑见威严，丽江大理拜古城，哈尔滨的冰城<br>
    流连，忽然乐怕，匆匆告别，归拖开生的人，如匆可爱的水城，喉深孔<br>
    入生活，吸吮生活的骨髓。</p>

    <div class="spacer"></div>

    <p>你在其间，独一无二，不可或缺，无论你是何种角色，都不要要<br>
    历史的大潮席汲，或者冲刷去你的独立存在，至少你要在大时代中做行仕<br>
    <span class="highlight">强的小人物，在狂欢夜中做自由的舒着</span></p>

    <div class="spacer"></div>

    <p class="title-line">刘拓：用生命为文物留影的年轻人</p>

  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
